  "content": [
    {
      "from": "DET Ron Colangelo",
      "time": "9:03 AM",
      "text": "Your attendance story is fine but the headline is misleading. Freep headline writers need to read your story. Misleading"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Ron Colangelo",
      "time": "9:26 AM",
      "text": "The headline on the website"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "9:30 AM",
      "text": "Detroit Tigers hot at Comerica Park, but attendance still down"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "9:31 AM",
      "text": "?"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "9:32 AM",
      "text": "That one?"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Ron Colangelo",
      "time": "9:33 AM",
      "text": "Yes"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Ron Colangelo",
      "time": "9:34 AM",
      "text": "You should have let me know you were writing this story."
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "9:34 AM",
      "text": "What do you suggest it should be?"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Ron Colangelo",
      "time": "9:36 AM",
      "text": "Slightly down"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Ron Colangelo",
      "time": "9:36 AM",
      "text": "Jumped the gun"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Ron Colangelo",
      "time": "9:36 AM",
      "text": "Summer is here"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Ron Colangelo",
      "time": "9:37 AM",
      "text": "School is out"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Ron Colangelo",
      "time": "9:37 AM",
      "text": "Weather was terrible in April and May"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Ron Colangelo",
      "time": "9:39 AM",
      "text": "We have big crowds this weekend"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Ron Colangelo",
      "time": "9:39 AM",
      "text": "That will increase average attendance"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "9:40 AM",
      "text": "I didn't even want to write that story, I'm just doing what I'm told"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Ron Colangelo",
      "time": "9:40 AM",
      "text": "Guessing that was the case"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Ron Colangelo",
      "time": "9:40 AM",
      "text": "Kevin Bull"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Ron Colangelo",
      "time": "11:37 AM",
      "text": "I reached out to the asst editor since Kevin is out"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "11:39 AM",
      "text": "Ok"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Ron Colangelo",
      "time": "3:10 PM",
      "text": "Spoke with David Darby. Bull is out of town"
    }
  ]
}